// text. A term ISACA's documents use but don't define is left out and
// goes on the request list instead (docs/Glossary_Terms_To_Request.md).
//
//   "term"     the word or phrase, as the documents write it
//   "quote"    one or more exact passages from the document; shown in
//              order ("bullets": true shows them as a list)
//   "document" the document's "document" value in onboarding/library.json
//   "pages"    optional: the President Guidebook page it is on
//   "where"    the part of the document, as shown under the quote
//
// Read at runtime: edit, save and reopen; no rebuild. Run the check
// after any change: python onboarding/check_glossary.py
// Lines starting with // are comments and are ignored.
// ============================================================
